## SESSION HANDOFF PROTOCOL

At the end of every session (or when Dee says "save everything" / "push to git"):
1. Update `CO_OUTREACH_TRACKER.md` with all emails sent this session
2. Update `PENDING_COS_FOR_LATER.md` — remove completed, add new
3. Update `BID_TRACKER_DASHBOARD.md` if any bid status changed
4. Update `NEXUS_WATCH_LIST.md` if any new solicitations are being monitored
5. Run `git add -A && git commit` with a clear summary of what was done
6. Confirm to Dee: "Saved. Next chat will pick up at [specific next action]."

